{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026axk2b8xqqc1792774659.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞殘運，陳睿琳混合泳增添銀牌。</p><p></p><p>游泳壓軸比賽日，第五線的陳睿琳，女子SM14級200米混合泳，第一項蝶泳排第二，之後背泳、蛙泳及自由泳，未能追上亞洲紀錄保持者、日本的木下愛良，對方游出2分25秒68，陳睿琳以2分32秒44，慢6秒76，第二名觸池，個人以1金1銀2銅完成今屆賽事。</p><p></p><p>硬地滾球的梁育榮及張沅，BC4雙人賽坐銀望金。而BC3的謝德樺及陳浩欣，四強完成四局，以1-6不敵日本，轉戰銅牌戰。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T18:04:15.132914+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T15:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:12.629972+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T17:58:26.074000+00:00","content_hash":"2c816c6019397de653fcf00145defc554b521516864ff0a0e11ef73fdf71be53","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T18:04:15.132914+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}